{'symbol': 'APA', 'date': '2022-07-14 17:15:00', 'title': 'APA CORPORATION BOARD CHAIR JOHN E. LOWE ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT; DIRECTOR H.', 'text': 'HOUSTON, JULY 14, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- APA CORPORATION (NASDAQ: APA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ELECTION OF H. LAMAR MCKAY AS THE NEXT CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD. THIS FOLLOWS THE ANNOUNCEMENT BY CURRENT CHAIRMAN JOHN E. LOWE OF HIS DECISION TO RETIRE. FOLLOWING A TRANSITION PERIOD, THE CHANGE WILL BE EFFECTIVE SEPT. 1.'}